<runspec version="MOVES5.0.1">
	<description><![CDATA[ONROAD half of the former mixed-onroad-nonroad scenario. Washtenaw County, single hour, gasoline passenger car, Total + Fossil Fuel Energy for running and start exhaust. Canonical MOVES 5.0.1 cannot run ONROAD and NONROAD in one RunSpec (ExecutionRunSpec.buildVehicleSelections leaves the M12 case unimplemented), so the mixed run was split into this onroad fixture and nr-mixed-nonroad (the nonroad half). Energy (pollutants 91/93) is onroad-only — nonroad does not model it.]]></description>
	<models>
		<model value="ONROAD"/>
	</models>
	<modelscale value="Inv"/>
	<modeldomain value="DEFAULT"/>
	<geographicselections>
		<geographicselection type="COUNTY" key="26161" description="MICHIGAN - Washtenaw County"/>
	</geographicselections>
